# Diagnostics nothing provokes, one per line: layer TAB text. A list and
# not a count, so one reached cannot hide one added. A diagnostic missing
# from here that nothing provokes is red, and so is one listed here that
# something provokes now — remove those with `reach.py --prune`, which
# only removes. `--baseline` rewrites the whole file: deliberate, and
# separate, like messages/baseline.txt.
